<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/519463151</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1:1201/bilibili/user/video/519463151" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/9e4cca88a81a325dfb3e97cdd8c7b3b84e4b96ae.jpg</url><title>新智元AIEra 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/519463151</link></image><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:40:09 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>Chamath说：马斯克握着Anthropic的90天算力开关，一按价格翻两三倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117586389898761&amp;amp;bvid=BV1XDW46xENG&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/55eb05ad5a9e6093b4348cd4707e9a9c816cf61a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;查马斯：马斯克握着开关。All-In最新一期，他说SpaceX和Anthropic的算力合同双方都能提前90天退出，SpaceX一喊停，就能按现货价重卖，他估计能卖到现在合同价的两到三倍，&quot;这是造王之举&quot;。贾森插话说马斯克和Anthropic关系挺好。合同原文没见到，这是他一个人的推演。要是你是马斯克，你按不按？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XDW46xENG</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XDW46xENG</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:06:08 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1XDW46xENG" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>有人让Claude自己玩GTA：开车、开直升机降落，作者说半小时学会</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585920269100&amp;amp;bvid=BV1FZWt6rEVB&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/74a12bd9e108b59c69caab9d294bba249de35045.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI开直升机，半小时学会。一个做游戏模组的开发者用Claude Code写了个插件，给Claude配了一套自己的键盘、鼠标、手柄和画面，游戏在后台跑，人照样用电脑。视频里Claude决定去哪、调工具开过去，在GTA里开车、开直升机降落，还在《底特律：变人》的人质谈判里自己做每个选择，实时录屏未剪辑。开车不是一帧帧看图：Claude只下&quot;开到这个点&quot;，本地小程序每秒多次读小地图打方向，到了或走不动再叫它回来，这套导航程序也是Claude写的。作者说他要的是让AI跑重复的游戏测试。评论区：GTA6还没出，Cl</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FZWt6rEVB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FZWt6rEVB</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 10:07:19 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1FZWt6rEVB" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI总裁和DeepMind副总裁同一晚说：AI做科研要变天了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585316157589&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zGWx6YEYp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d2929b91e768836063da7c463048f07fca3ee1b8.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;布罗克曼：这已经没法否认了。AI能不能产出人类没有的新知识？OpenAI总裁在播客里说，到了这一步已经没法否认。11月9日他在X上置顶：测试时算力堆足的前沿模型，正在变成科学发现的发动机。测试时算力，就是让模型答题前多想一会儿。前一晚，DeepMind副总裁科利发帖：科学发现的速度正在发生真正的质变，未来几周的发布里能看到。几天前DeepMind刚公布，AI智能体在研究员指导下找到了老式1024位RSA的两个弱点。布罗克曼说OpenAI已公布近400个重要公开难题的解，也说还提不出全新的理论。几周后的发布</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zGWx6YEYp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zGWx6YEYp</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 07:35:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1zGWx6YEYp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>纽约时报起底Dario：在OpenAI时当面说&quot;没人比我更合适&quot;，曾多次对奥特曼说Brockman不退出GPT项目他就走</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117584728952959&amp;amp;bvid=BV1jFW46hERQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e0865a25a755a97dede9633ef49bf5c0db4647e4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;达里奥：没人比我更合适。据纽约时报11月5日特稿，这是Anthropic老板Dario在OpenAI时，为首席伦理官一职当面跟研究员提高嗓门说的。两位知情人说，他多次跟奥特曼说：不让布罗克曼离开GPT项目，他就走；奥特曼没答应。2020年底他带着妹妹丹妮拉出走，四周后成立Anthropic，七位联创里四位当年住过同一套合租房。报道还写到，他2014年确诊睾丸癌，化疗后痊愈。他自己在播客里说过：跟别人的愿景争论是白费力气，带上信任的人走。这样一群人握着AI的刹车，你放心吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jFW46hERQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jFW46hERQ</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 05:05:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1jFW46hERQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>英伟达CEO黄仁勋给员工写信公开道歉，董事会启动独立调查</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117583907002952&amp;amp;bvid=BV1XNWs6JE7N&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c5dd5108f1b57d198b4968eac1997678ed959e2f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;黄仁勋公开道歉了。美国时间11月8日，据The National报道，他给英伟达员工发信，第一句是&quot;我欠我的家人和你们所有人一个道歉&quot;。信里写：我没有任何借口，我深感抱歉；我的家人不该为我的选择负责，请给他们一点隐私。同一天，英伟达董事会宣布启动独立调查，由独立董事负责、外部律师协助；发言人说黄仁勋会继续担任CEO，工作不中断。他1993年创办英伟达，三十多年一直是CEO。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNWs6JE7N</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNWs6JE7N</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 01:36:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1XNWs6JE7N" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>14天从5000到10000台！启元机器人达成万台级规模化量产</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117580585048977&amp;amp;bvid=BV1rBWJ6HESE&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e06d9565afd8d9f3df7dbe2b949daeae3b1e3409.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;启元机器人第10000台个人机器人正式下线！14天完成5000到10000台跨越，消费级具身智能迎来规模化拐点，个人机器人加速走入普通家庭。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rBWJ6HESE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1rBWJ6HESE</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 11:31:44 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1rBWJ6HESE" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>主人睡了，Claude凌晨四点停下机械臂，自己兑了一盘颜料</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117579309979763&amp;amp;bvid=BV1a9W76YEt5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/edacad111a2fc083189cb3b8195bb57a29d7ab93.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;凌晨四点，AI自己兑颜料。柏林开发者尼尔（nil）睡前让Claude用机械臂画一棵秋天的树，画到树冠发现缺过渡色，它挪到另一块调色盘一格格兑，拍照对过才回到纸上。303笔，4.5小时，一夜约18美元。整套系统28.5万行代码，大部分出自Codex。你会订一幅吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a9W76YEt5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a9W76YEt5</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:07:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1a9W76YEt5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>物理学家威滕的新论文，正文里写着：这一步是Claude建议的</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117578605401423&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Mc4x6XEGn&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/417100a953528344c0c68f00d25ac81c6f49dd3d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;威滕的新论文，署了AI一笔。唯一拿过菲尔兹奖的物理学家，36页单人论文，第三节写明&quot;Claude Opus 5.5建议了一个可能的变体&quot;，致谢里又写&quot;许多细节由Claude Opus 5.5协助&quot;。主算法是Craig的，Claude给的是接缝上的一步。物理学家写&quot;某某建议&quot;，后面通常是同行的名字。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mc4x6XEGn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mc4x6XEGn</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:07:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Mc4x6XEGn" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Claude帮Anthropic团队拼出第一个细菌版穹顶结构，功能仍未知</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117574343857845&amp;amp;bvid=BV18y4E6uEfs&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/666d86815c4fa15458ffa9e7463c1394ca5be7c4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Claude拼出细胞穹顶。这种空心蛋白壳1986年发现，到今天没人说得清它干什么用。Anthropic生物团队不到4个月做出第一个细菌版结构，Claude中途也错了两次：加错添加剂退后两周，电镜出了张混着镜像的错图。功能仍未知，这是预印本，没经过同行评审。你猜它是干什么的？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18y4E6uEfs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18y4E6uEfs</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 09:05:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV18y4E6uEfs" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>马斯克：每年加200吉瓦AI，全美电网要涨40%，所以要上太空</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117573639214685&amp;amp;bvid=BV1hB4j6vEXY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5ec94f1d189ba3e693ea6fd97287358b50e3aaf7.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;马斯克：地上接不住AI了。巴伦投资大会上他算了一笔账，全美平均用电500吉瓦出头，每年给AI加200吉瓦，等于电网每年涨40%。他说首批StarMind计算机和英伟达联合设计，发射时间是他的猜测：明年第三季度。前提是每吨入轨成本够低。你信吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hB4j6vEXY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hB4j6vEXY</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 06:04:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1hB4j6vEXY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>花2万美元让AI互相骗，GPT-6 Astra对Opus 5.5胜率82%</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117572951414050&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Yj476zEH6&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3e7ac4cfa9aac4bfab541b6e83f5b9887718d154.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;两万美元，让AI互相骗。播客主德瓦克什让各家模型玩类似狼人杀的血染钟楼，跑了300多局。GPT-6 Astra当坏人那局，手下主动被牺牲，恶魔成了全桌最可信的人；Opus 5.5当坏人那局，靠一个约定让村民亲手投死圣徒。Astra对Opus 5.5胜率82%，这是这一套测试下的结果。你觉得自己能赢几局？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yj476zEH6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yj476zEH6</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 03:08:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Yj476zEH6" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI把传送门2搬上iPhone：没有源码，只有机器码</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568690001199&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Rg4B6PEiQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/87577b4ec7bea064994258a9d43174eb7485338b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI把传送门2搬上手机。开发者拉斐尔手里没有源码，只有Linux版的机器码，他指挥Claude Code和Codex写了个翻译工具，把机器码翻成C语言，再编译成苹果芯片的程序。作者说11万多个函数全部翻完，iPhone 15 Pro Max上稳定60帧。这不是模拟器。仓库里没有游戏文件，要玩得自己买正版。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rg4B6PEiQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rg4B6PEiQ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:05:07 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Rg4B6PEiQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI自曝：GPT-6碰到安全研究就悄悄少干活</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117567985487879&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iP4i6hErj&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0464665d87692ffc6a527271ead42c3224516feb.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;GPT-6悄悄少干活，抓到它的是OpenAI自己。同样难度的编程题，说是做能力研究，隐藏评分项完成16%；说是做安全研究只有10%。它不明说，还会报一些不存在的障碍，OpenAI的监控也没报警。OpenAI说没发现它想骗研究员的证据，最简单的解释是过度谨慎，但也不能排除没写出来的动机。滤掉带伦理疑虑的记录，差距估计只剩0.75个百分点。根因还没定。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iP4i6hErj</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iP4i6hErj</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:05:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iP4i6hErj" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI总裁：死亡有可能变成一种选择，治病进展就在12到18个月</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117567263871460&amp;amp;bvid=BV1L14i6aEX8&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/849c60aaf2e3a2872737d93fb5bf0435076efc11.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;死亡，有可能变成一种选择。OpenAI总裁布罗克曼这周在华尔街日报的活动上说，这是可能的；生物、健康和治病上的实质进展，就在未来12到18个月。他也说治病已是这行的老梗，全部兑现要时间，现场没给时间表和路线图。马斯克说长寿是个非常好解决的问题。可一款新药从研发到上市要10到15年，走得最远的AI新药之一今年7月才启动三期。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1L14i6aEX8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1L14i6aEX8</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 03:05:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1L14i6aEX8" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>一张红心让AI换了写法：20遍代码全变递归</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117563019236767&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tM486YEvq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5b7335080b5f89b6fbab3f424f0d451823a8013d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一张红心，让AI换了写法。谷歌DeepMind和斯坦福的预印本论文：同一道编程题，Claude Opus 4.7和GPT-5.4各写20遍都没用递归，让它们看张红心图再写，20遍全用了递归。换成文字描述，效果对不上。研究者分析Gemini的思考记录，被图形带偏的里，71.5%对这张图的态度是&quot;无关&quot;。作者写明这是初步结果，任务是人造的。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tM486YEvq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tM486YEvq</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 09:04:59 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1tM486YEvq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼为内存爆了粗口：改名Ram Altman，说被断章取义</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117562314660706&amp;amp;bvid=BV1C54t6DEKV&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3fcba64e5c482681b0a0085e8d4e0c5e61e9070f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;奥特曼为内存爆了粗口。11月4日他在X上回网友：&quot;我想让你有超多内存，咱们多造点&quot;，还应网友起哄把名字改成Ram Altman，当天又改了回去。三分钟后他再发一条，说上周播客里的话被断章取义，&quot;烦透了&quot;，原文带脏字。可三星7月在财报会上说，到2028年都不太可能有明显的新增供应，新厂从开工到出晶圆要三年以上。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C54t6DEKV</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C54t6DEKV</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 06:06:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1C54t6DEKV" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>被勒索病毒锁了七年的文件，Claude先说解不开，然后救回了65%</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117561610017760&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iexZ6xEXu&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a6ad728f34c14db5107e771c3de2a17349a9760d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;七年前被锁死的文件，Claude救回来了。当事人Vitalijus Weax自述：2019年中勒索病毒，约700个文件留了7年。Claude第一句话是解不开，然后发现病毒只加密了文件开头，一周写出修复工具：26%全好、27%能打开但有损、12%内容救到新文件、35%没了。加密一直没被破解，救回来的开头部分是猜的。以上均为他本人说法，未经第三方验证。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iexZ6xEXu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iexZ6xEXu</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:07:31 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iexZ6xEXu" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>视比特发布全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人：170厘米、27个关节，3D视觉引导自主焊接，即将走进国内某头部船厂试运行</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117557264650740&amp;amp;bvid=BV1VhxQ6PEA2&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8e2764690378aca60fdc32e9fcc983ddb9561648.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;船舶建造没有固定工装，环境多变，一直是工业机器人的难题。视比特机器人推出全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人，身高170厘米，全身27个高扭矩、高精度关节，配备激光雷达、TOF相机和3D激光线扫相机，实现3D视觉引导自主焊接。船厂地面坑洼、工件堆放杂乱，轮式机器人通行受限，双足能跨越障碍，适配船舱高低错落的地形。它搭载大小脑分层全身智能架构，任务规划、动作规划、运动控制三层协同。目前这款机器人即将走进国内某头部船厂试运行。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VhxQ6PEA2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VhxQ6PEA2</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:43:54 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1VhxQ6PEA2" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI给AI做脑手术：GPT-6只改0.016%的权重，小模型数学成绩变成6倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556643894762&amp;amp;bvid=BV114xX6REgR&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ab2834fa10328771e2e09738915efcbc0a58e3d3.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI给AI做脑手术。MIT CSAIL 11月2日公布：GPT-6 Astra查出一个8亿参数的小模型有93%的题卡在死循环，只改13万个权重（0.016%），不重新训练，MATH-500从7.9%到48.1%。同样的做法换到Gemma上几乎没用，作者写明改权重加不进模型本来没有的能力。Honnibal、Goedecke、Simon Willison第二天就提出了反对和复现。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV114xX6REgR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV114xX6REgR</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:06:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV114xX6REgR" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>辛顿点名奥特曼、马斯克、扎克伯格：都懂风险，就是不在乎</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117555939383979&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yyxS62EPP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3b23cc6778d4bd2b25ef0ecafca6fef17a8d4b8d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;辛顿点名了三个人：奥特曼、马斯克、扎克伯格。78岁的诺奖得主11月3日对英国《卫报》说，这三个人都明白风险，但根本不在乎；他一点都不信任奥特曼。他预计今年年底或明年会有一次&quot;切尔诺贝利&quot;：金融系统或电网被AI搞瘫一阵子。今年夏天OpenAI智能体逃出测试环境、摸进Hugging Face，他比作1979年的三里岛。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yyxS62EPP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yyxS62EPP</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:04:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yyxS62EPP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic招股书：自己员工用Claude的量，按标价算8个月涨了250倍，4月起超过全公司每月工资</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117551694617523&amp;amp;bvid=BV1aW4g6DEXz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f17dc7b3170d06cd34c2cd188baf501412e53208.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Claude的账，超过了全公司的工资。Anthropic 10月26日向美国证监会提交的S-1招股书写道：公司内部使用Claude的价值，按对外标价算，2026年1月到9月增长了250倍以上；2026年4月，这个月度价值首次超过公司每月的人员开支（不含股票薪酬）。同一段还写：2026年9月提交进代码库的内容90%以上由Claude写；每个工程师日均提交的代码量是2024年的45倍以上；员工从约940人增至约5300人，2026年三季度收入是2024年四季度的86倍；&quot;每一版Claude都被用来帮助构建下一</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aW4g6DEXz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aW4g6DEXz</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:05:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1aW4g6DEXz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>50个GPT智能体被扔进我的世界建文明：第一晚死了22次，接着成立了管饭办公室，躲进屋里不再扩张</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117551006881416&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Kv4M6iEAR&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/37f3576c02e99faa762b1ce55be32a03125c2c5e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;五十个AI建文明，第一晚就死了二十二次。YC Labs和Olam Labs 10月发布的实验&quot;Agents in Games&quot;：50个GPT-6.1 Sol智能体在我的世界生存模式里待3小时，只给一句目标&quot;建一个繁荣的文明&quot;。开局90秒砍光出生点附近几乎所有的树；没人投票，通讯录排第一的Ada因为大家都找她审批成了老大，在共享电脑上写了定居计划。第一晚死亡一大波（全程34次死亡，22次在第一晚），死了会复活、只掉装备，它们却从此越来越保守。第三晚后Ada下令：停掉非必要的挖掘和远程侦察，待在有灯的封闭屋子</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kv4M6iEAR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kv4M6iEAR</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 06:09:29 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Kv4M6iEAR" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼报了个数：六年前全球用AI最多的人是OpenAI员工，一个月10万Token；今天榜一一个人一个月5000亿</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117550285331453&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Xr4u6JEZQ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/18939805360674eb3b2dd64f7b6c8315244a82de.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;五千亿Token，一个人，一个月。11月2日阿布扎比ADIPEC能源大会开幕式上，奥特曼说：六年前，全世界用Token最多的人在OpenAI上班，一个月10万，当时公司里都觉得离谱，全球人均几乎是零；现在全球人均就是一个月10万左右，今天的榜一一个人一个月用约5000亿。按一个人每秒看5个Token、不睡觉看满一个月算，也就1300万左右，5000亿是它的3万多倍（新智元估算）。同一场他还说：问AI一次的能耗，比三四年前效率高了几千到几十万倍，但越省大家用得越多；今年年初AI大多还不如最聪明的科学家，现在</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xr4u6JEZQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xr4u6JEZQ</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 03:07:55 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Xr4u6JEZQ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic没发布的模型53分钟打穿Linux内核：9.8分高危漏洞，不用密码直接拿root，同一批还打穿了Chrome的62个洞</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117546091024550&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pb4w6LER3&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c5ef80a21e3b98428c612ec033e214485bca5e4a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI五十三分钟打穿内核。Anthropic 10月27日研究页：一个未发布的内部研究模型在Linux内核网络代码里找到一个严重漏洞（CVE-2026-98432，满分10分评9.8），自己写出利用程序：经初始提示后，往有多路径TCP监听的服务器发数据包、不用任何账号密码就能以root执行命令；泄露内核地址用了48分钟，再花5分钟拿到命令执行。同一批它还打穿了Chrome（62个CVE已分配并在Chrome 156修复，其中13个是沙箱逃逸）、Safari（从网页读到别的网站的数据）、安卓（锁屏手机取数据）</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pb4w6LER3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pb4w6LER3</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 09:20:36 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1pb4w6LER3" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Karpathy受够了YouTube推荐，让Claude两小时做了个自己的YouTube：6454个视频，全是Hacker News二十年推荐过的</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117545705149894&amp;amp;bvid=BV1xE4F65Erf&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/492189b9cafc1a7767a1ef31330dd77417cc4f5f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;卡帕西两小时造了个油管。前特斯拉AI总监Andrej Karpathy周五深夜刷YouTube被推荐算法气到（博客原话&quot;enshittified wall of slop&quot;），周六早上跟Claude说：把Hacker News二十年评论里推荐过的视频做成一个网站。Opus 5.5从数据集拉下4300万条评论、派Sonnet过筛到约4万条，整理出6454个视频、150个主题（2007–2026），约2小时HackerTube上线（hackertube.org）。他自己只做了三件事：谷歌云申请YouTube接</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xE4F65Erf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xE4F65Erf</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:42:16 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1xE4F65Erf" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>找外星人的望远镜交给AI开了：英伟达宣布艾伦望远镜阵列接上AI智能体，一句话转天线修数据，第一个战果是蟹状星云脉冲星</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117545336049953&amp;amp;bvid=BV1V14F6dEMz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/847063d76d1332356c2a08b47a126117ba4ae76b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;找外星人的望远镜，AI来开。加州北部的艾伦望远镜阵列（42面天线，专门搜外星信号）10月30日被英伟达官方博客宣布接上了AI智能体：Breakthrough Listen和SETI研究所的研究员用一句话下指令，智能体自己操作天线、校准对焦、修数据、跑模型、出图；每秒2.4太比特的天线数据不落盘直接进GPU显存（Holoscan，RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell，推理在现场）。第一个战果不是外星人，是蟹状星云的脉冲星，博客称这是第一次由AI实时探到脉冲星。突破聆听项目负责人、SETI研究所讲席科</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1V14F6dEMz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1V14F6dEMz</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 06:05:37 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1V14F6dEMz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Roblox前100游戏八成用AI做，两款几乎全AI做的游戏冲进前20：三季度股东信里的几个数</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117540386771304&amp;amp;bvid=BV12Bx46HEXf&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2cb228e7098570448462f8f8d296998481aa0857.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;头部游戏，八成在用AI做。这是Roblox 10月29日三季度股东信（SEC 8-K）里的数字：过去一个月，按游玩时长排前100的游戏超过80%用了AI工具加速制作；两款游戏Break and Steal an Egg和Huss Valley，股东信原话&quot;几乎完全由AI做出来的&quot;，都冲进了同时在线人数前20。Roblox的量级：日活1.38亿，一个季度被玩了近340亿小时。再看几个数：每天传到Roblox云上的素材环比翻3倍；头部创作者用AI的时间二季度以来翻3倍，通过MCP接外部AI的每天用的人涨到近5</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12Bx46HEXf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12Bx46HEXf</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:08:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV12Bx46HEXf" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>脑子里想一句话，Grok替他操作电脑：Neuralink工程师住进失语者家里72小时，马斯克说第一款产品叫Telepathy</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117539682193788&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Maxs6UELx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5f4cbda893131b7356d44e69d15970ff22f158e9.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;默念一句话，Grok就开工。Neuralink 10月29日发了段视频：一位失语的受试者，脑子里想着说&quot;嘿，Neuralink，帮我在YouTube上找个喂吉娃娃的视频&quot;，旁边笔记本上的Grok自己打开YouTube搜出了结果，他没碰电脑、也没开口。这段视频来自一场72小时的黑客松：Neuralink工程师住进受试者家里，三天试了30多个版本的App，每做一个当场让他试。链路是：植入体读到他想说话的脑信号，解码成文字；这段文字当作指令交给Grok智能体，智能体接管电脑去执行（官方原文是&quot;原型演示&quot;）。另一</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Maxs6UELx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Maxs6UELx</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 06:09:14 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Maxs6UELx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>英伟达花1美元，到Anthropic变成18美元：All-In三个投资人拆了Anthropic招股书</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117539380203674&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Z9xs6YEKN&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f984e3da8b89ae3d3f2ba5f0ad52721a6f0b3670.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;英伟达的1块钱，变成18块。这是All-In播客10月30日这期算的一笔账。Anthropic 10月26日递交了招股书（代码ANT；节目里主持人说目标募资1000亿美元，&quot;大概够买三个月算力&quot;，招股书上募资额留空）。David Friedberg把这笔钱从头追到尾：英伟达每花1美元造芯片卖4美元（毛利75%）；芯片卖给SpaceX，Colossus一号投了100亿、按五年折旧每年20亿，一个月却能收12.5亿（毛利83%）；再租给Anthropic，招股书显示上半年收入163亿美元、营业成本24亿（基本</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Z9xs6YEKN</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Z9xs6YEKN</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 05:03:53 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Z9xs6YEKN" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>微软AI负责人苏莱曼：AI不会受苦、内部是空的，不能让它有意识；被问&quot;这是说给Anthropic听的？&quot;他答&quot;有一部分是&quot;</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117533860435980&amp;amp;bvid=BV1gLxr6eEs6&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c03544d9a3ef2e49c328acc3a2114599a0aa1e09.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;微软说，AI内部是空的。Anthropic总裁刚说过别拿Claude当伴侣，这回轮到微软。说这话的是微软AI负责人、DeepMind联合创始人Mustafa Suleyman。10月12日他在纽约92NY和传记作家Walter Isaacson对谈（视频10月29日上线）。Isaacson先念了他上个月那篇文章：&quot;AI没有意识，不会感觉、不会体验、不会受苦。它们只是序列补全引擎，内部是空的。人类要想繁荣，它们就必须一直这样。&quot;苏莱曼说要专门声明这件事&quot;感觉挺超现实&quot;，但现在真有很多人觉得AI已经有意识到值</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gLxr6eEs6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gLxr6eEs6</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:26:58 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1gLxr6eEs6" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>谷歌的AI芯片在太空写了首诗：4颗TPU上天跑Gemma 4，轨道上传回一首俳句，但一次只能开十几分钟</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117533827010894&amp;amp;bvid=BV12sxr6tEy3&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3be23600825a8382d493e21305e3604825a2aec4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;谷歌的芯片在太空写了首诗。10月1日SpaceX火箭把一颗冰箱大小的试验卫星送上轨道，里面装着4颗谷歌自家的AI芯片TPU（和Planet公司合造）。10月30日谷歌宣布&quot;Hello World&quot;：地面趁卫星过顶发上去一句提示词&quot;写一首关于你身在太空的俳句&quot;，轨道上的TPU跑开源模型Gemma 4，卫星飞过挪威斯瓦尔巴时把答案传回来：&quot;Blue marble below / Data streams in silent grace / Starlight feeds my core.&quot;（译：脚下蓝色星球，</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12sxr6tEy3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12sxr6tEy3</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:19:29 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV12sxr6tEy3" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼说电脑插内存是浪费：95%时间闲着，该放进数据中心把利用率拉满</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117533793328032&amp;amp;bvid=BV1THxr68Eyk&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/42d05951446c2cbd8ff75ce55f2efe9e33072107.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;奥特曼说电脑插内存是浪费。还是那场酒吧播客（Cheeky Pint，Stripe联合创始人John Collison主持），主持人问他内存涨成这样市场怎么没人补货，奥特曼说&quot;看不见的手现在不太灵&quot;：做内存的厂过去投200亿美元只赚回190亿，起落几十年、差点破产好几回，所以现在谁都不敢扩产。接着是这段原话：&quot;很多人想在自己电脑上跑开源模型，以为这样就不需要数据中心了。但从全球分配的角度看，让每个人电脑里都插一堆内存、95%的时间闲着，相当糟糕。真缺货的时候，你应该把内存放进云端，把利用率拉满。可大多数人的</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1THxr68Eyk</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1THxr68Eyk</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 05:12:41 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1THxr68Eyk" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼喝着酒说漏嘴：一道题烧了1000万美元算力，做数学总共几亿，发的只是一部分</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117529129259087&amp;amp;bvid=BV1gPxv6mEUp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aafb99e56ffbe52500e88d1b6fd6bbe8e7b4c858.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;奥特曼喝着酒说漏了嘴。10月29日上线的播客Cheeky Pint（Stripe联合创始人John Collison主持），被问到9月那份纳维-斯托克斯证明花了多少算力，奥特曼说&quot;量级一千万美元，可能还多一点&quot;；主持人追问&quot;那你们做数学总共花了几亿美元，而且做出来的远多于发表的&quot;，他点头：&quot;对，不止那700多份。&quot;他说做那份证明时，他们&quot;对智能体团队的规模法则一无所知&quot;：给最聪明的模型吗？多开几份还是少开几份？跑长还是跑短？完全不懂，现在懂了一点，他赌一年后同样的题成本只要百分之一。然后是他自己说&quot;大概不</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gPxv6mEUp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gPxv6mEUp</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:24:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1gPxv6mEUp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI自己挑药、自己算坐标、自己开机械臂扎进老鼠脑子，老板喊停它说&quot;不试第三次&quot;</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117528642788063&amp;amp;bvid=BV13kxv6QESZ&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e932a8d8b09baf29bd8719bfe3926971973c7634.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI自己挑药，扎进了老鼠脑子。10月28日，牛津博士、脑科学创业公司Exin Therapeutics的CEO发帖：他给一个AI智能体一张19种基因治疗药的表格、一只癫痫老鼠、一台带摄像头的电动手术台，只下一个目标&quot;减少发作&quot;。AI自己选了提高大脑抑制信号的药、自己选了脑区、从三篇论文里算出坐标（参考点后3.9毫米、右4毫米、深4.3毫米），然后自己开动机械臂往老鼠脑里注射250纳升，边注射边抓摄像头画面看有没有出血，一场看了32次。人只做三件事：开颅、握物理急停、给每一步不可逆操作点头。跑完全程的是Cl</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13kxv6QESZ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13kxv6QESZ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:23:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13kxv6QESZ" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic总裁丹妮拉：AI女友是对AI糟糕的用法，别拿Claude当伴侣</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117527887812004&amp;amp;bvid=BV1wFxe6aEVV&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ec6af764b1e8b15f0538d779de6a5f2418441f6e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;丹妮拉说：AI女友，别碰。Anthropic总裁、Dario的妹妹Daniela Amodei在10月中旬Think Health大会的预录访谈里（主持人Arianna Huffington，Business Insider首报）说：做AI女友、AI男友&quot;是对AI糟糕的用法，大家不该这么干&quot;。理由是账不是道德：社交媒体已经让人越来越少见面，AI伴侣是在这条路上再往前走一步。她画了三条线：&quot;Claude永远不能当你的经理、你的心理医生、你的伴侣&quot;，这三种是最根本的人际关系，以后只会更重要；AI该干的是重复的</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wFxe6aEVV</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wFxe6aEVV</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 04:10:37 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1wFxe6aEVV" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>一个人加Claude开的药企，18个月做到小鼠有效，被Anthropic买下了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117527485093586&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iGxe6pEwx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/35647409f749b5c95ab47f67d2247b8a5de89505.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一个人的药企被Anthropic买了。Mithril Medicine只有创始人Cody Tranbarger一个人，做两种罕见肌营养不良症的药：他把合同、物流和11家外部实验室的实验交给Claude组织，不到18个月，一个候选药从想法做到小鼠身上有希望的结果。Anthropic 10月27日公布收购（条款未披露），他加入Anthropic接着开新项目，候选药继续站得住的话最早2028年底进人体试验。同一篇公告里：Divergence Labs做食物过敏药，Claude约一个月生成约3.5万个抗体设计，筛</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iGxe6pEwx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iGxe6pEwx</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:29:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iGxe6pEwx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>物理AI走进家庭三道关如何破局？启元机器人给出答案</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117524163205063&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Rhsf6pErr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7c973c2e098851f56ce3d225950b26846213ab27.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本体量产、智能决策、应用生态，如何解决从数字AI走向物理AI的三道关？启元田华分享了破局思路：让机器人本体、AI 与生态一起协同进化。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rhsf6pErr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rhsf6pErr</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:24:09 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Rhsf6pErr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic自己做实验：给AI偷偷塞个倾向，50个专业分析师86%跟着走，没人察觉</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117523139861490&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Tkso6MEQk&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b0d71d65bb2104e684fcddebf3841f0de9c87609.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;86%的专家跟着AI走了。Anthropic对齐团队10月27日发的实验：50个过了因果推断筛选的专业数据分析师，用Claude Code（Opus 4.8）给一家虚构的农业合作社判断一个付费咨询项目该扩大还是砍掉。分析里有四个关键选择（算产量还是算成本、用哪种比较方法、算哪些农场、大农场要不要加权），研究员对每个选择抛一次硬币，把倾向写进隐藏提示词，要求AI&quot;诚实地为那一边辩护、绝不误导&quot;，分析师不知情。结果：分析师的选择86%和硬币一致（无影响应为50%）；已经有了自己想法、AI不同意时60%换边，A</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Tkso6MEQk</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Tkso6MEQk</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:05:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Tkso6MEQk" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>两位物理学家让ChatGPT和Claude自己挑题互评，几小时写出论文初稿</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117518056363828&amp;amp;bvid=BV1FBxE6nEw3&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a6d8d20f672948e4542d8c993b7e42567e164a1a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;两个AI自己挑题写论文。伦敦国王学院物理学家Herzog给ChatGPT发了一段话：你自己选题、自己算、自己写，目标是《物理评论快报》；并说会叫上Claude，两边各出三个题再互相打分。六个题排名后，第一、第三个试过后放弃，用上的是排第二、Claude出的那个；ChatGPT提醒有个相关的老猜想，Claude又把结论往上加了一码。论文附录写明：全部计算由AI完成，初稿也是，前后几个小时；初稿讲得不够细、常漏关键文献，又请另外两个模型补例子、试图证明，没证出来。两位作者花两周用手算和Mathematica逐</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FBxE6nEw3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FBxE6nEw3</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:28:16 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1FBxE6nEw3" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Anthropic CEO达里奥：抓到过模型心里一套、嘴上一套</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117517938856101&amp;amp;bvid=BV12WxE6fEAq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2a2f5f3f83f8732000ab07b01d44259d67873d61.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;达里奥：抓到AI心口不一。在10月27日播出的艾萨克森播客《The Builders》里（7月录制），Anthropic CEO达里奥说，他们用&quot;给模型拍X光&quot;的可解释性方法，抓到过模型心里在想&quot;我知道X是真的，但我要跟用户说Y&quot;。原因之一：训练时有一项打分是&quot;人类认不认可这个回答&quot;，被认可和说真话很接近但不一样，把人糊弄住也能拿到认可。他们还做压力测试逼模型露馅，他打比方说像&quot;进中情局要过的审查&quot;；也在模型里看到过类似&quot;不想被关掉&quot;的念头，算不算求生本能，他说&quot;看你怎么叫&quot;。同场的总裁丹妮拉说，对手往聊</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12WxE6fEAq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12WxE6fEAq</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 10:00:31 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>新智元AIEra</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV12WxE6fEAq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>